{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/133755-no-flesh-shall-be-spared","id":133755,"title":"NO FLESH SHALL BE SPARED","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Chronicles of Darkness","Demon: The Descent"],"posts":[{"date":"2014-05-12T08:18:38-07:00","id":133755,"title":"NO FLESH SHALL BE SPARED","content":"Last night I was looking through Demon, and got to the section on Agendas. Each Agenda has a symbol associated with it, some sort of odd glyph, inside a circle, surrounded by a small ring of sigils. Something about them looked familiar, and on a hunch, I looked up Enochian, and found that they corresponded to the angelic script. The symbols translate to &quot;NO FLESH SHALL BE SPARED NO FLESH SHALL BE SPARED,&quot; which may be a reference to Mark 13:20.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Mark 13:20 (KJV)</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\"><span style=\"font-size:14px\"><span style=\"font-family:arial\"><span style=\"color:#000000\">And except that the Lord had shortened those days, no flesh should be saved: but for the elect's sake, whom he hath chosen, he hath shortened the days.</span></span></span></div> </div> </div> </div>The actual quote &quot;No flesh shall be spared&quot; I can't find outside a British sci-fi horror film from the 90s called Hardware, in which the quote is crucial to the movie's plot twist. I can't find a Biblical translation that uses that literal phrasing though. It's quite interesting though. I wonder what it's supposed to mean in this context? Frankly I'm just relieved it didn't say &quot;As above, so below.&quot;<br /> <br /> So, Gospel of Mark. New Testament. Portrays Jesus's life as the Messiah, including his betrayal and crucifixion. Includes his miracles such as exorcism and healing, but, according to scholars, at least some of these were portrayed as sorcery. It's also the Gospel in which Jesus is accused of consorting with Beelzebub, prince of demons. So, hmm.<br /> <br /> Sorry if this has been pointed out before; I looked through the forums and didn't find anything on the topic, and I thought it was interesting enough to share. If anyone else has any insight into the quote and how it relates to Demon, that'd be great.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":3}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-12T09:09:38-07:00","id":133820,"title":"","content":"What about the actual symbols for the Agenda themselves? Do they amount to anything?<br /> <br /> I'll get back to thew question later today.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2014-05-12T11:05:51-07:00","id":134054,"title":"","content":"I don't know. They don't seem to correspond to any of John Dee's glyphs. The symbols over/on each demon in the section are Enochian though. The Inquisitor has Don (R), the Integrator has Pal (X), the Saboteur has Ur (L) and what might be Ged (G), and the Tempter has Pal on his/her chest, and Don in the background. It should also be noted that the Enochian on the Saboteur and Inquisitor are backward. Also, now that I look at it more, the smoke rising from the Inquisitor's gun forms Tal (M), and maybe something else, but I can't quite make it out.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1423-espritdecalmar","name":"espritdecalmar","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1423_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"941"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}